## Article 379. Replacement of party in enforcement proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article379PartyReplacement:
  input check content PartyReplacementCheck
  output partyMayBeReplaced content YesNo
  output tenDayHearingDeadline content YesNo

scope Article379PartyReplacement:
# Party replaced when withdrawn and successor exists
  label replaced definition partyMayBeReplaced under condition
    check.partyWithdrew = Yes
    and check.successorExists = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_replacement definition partyMayBeReplaced equals No

# Ten day hearing deadline
  label ten_days definition tenDayHearingDeadline under condition
    check.tenDaysSinceApplication = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label exceeded definition tenDayHearingDeadline equals No
```

## Article 380. Reversal of execution of court decisions

```catala
declaration scope Article380ExecutionReversal:
  input check content ExecutionReversalCheck
  output reversalByAppellateOrCassation content YesNo
  output reversalByNewReview content YesNo
  output reversalByExceptionalCircumstances content YesNo
  output oneYearApplicationDeadline content YesNo
  output twentyDayHearingDeadline content YesNo

scope Article380ExecutionReversal:
# Reversal by appellate or cassation court
  label cassation_closed definition reversalByAppellateOrCassation under condition
    check.cassationOrAppellateReversalGround = ReversalGround.ProceedingsClosed
    consequence equals Yes

  label cassation_without definition reversalByAppellateOrCassation under condition
    check.cassationOrAppellateReversalGround = ReversalGround.ClaimLeftWithoutConsideration
    consequence equals Yes

  label cassation_denied definition reversalByAppellateOrCassation under condition
    check.cassationOrAppellateReversalGround = ReversalGround.ClaimDeniedInFull
    consequence equals Yes

  label cassation_lesser definition reversalByAppellateOrCassation under condition
    check.cassationOrAppellateReversalGround = ReversalGround.ClaimSatisfiedInLesserAmount
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_cassation_reversal definition reversalByAppellateOrCassation equals No

# Reversal by new review after case returned
  label new_closed definition reversalByNewReview under condition
    check.newReviewReversalGround = ReversalGround.ProceedingsClosed
    consequence equals Yes

  label new_without definition reversalByNewReview under condition
    check.newReviewReversalGround = ReversalGround.ClaimLeftWithoutConsideration
    consequence equals Yes

  label new_denied definition reversalByNewReview under condition
    check.newReviewReversalGround = ReversalGround.ClaimDeniedInFull
    consequence equals Yes

  label new_lesser definition reversalByNewReview under condition
    check.newReviewReversalGround = ReversalGround.ClaimSatisfiedInLesserAmount
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_new_reversal definition reversalByNewReview equals No

# Reversal by exceptional circumstances review
  label exceptional_closed definition reversalByExceptionalCircumstances under condition
    check.exceptionalReviewReversalGround = ReversalGround.ProceedingsClosed
    consequence equals Yes

  label exceptional_without definition reversalByExceptionalCircumstances under condition
    check.exceptionalReviewReversalGround = ReversalGround.ClaimLeftWithoutConsideration
    consequence equals Yes

  label exceptional_denied definition reversalByExceptionalCircumstances under condition
    check.exceptionalReviewReversalGround = ReversalGround.ClaimDeniedInFull
    consequence equals Yes

  label exceptional_lesser definition reversalByExceptionalCircumstances under condition
    check.exceptionalReviewReversalGround = ReversalGround.ClaimSatisfiedInLesserAmount
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_exceptional_reversal definition reversalByExceptionalCircumstances equals No

# One year application deadline
  label within_year definition oneYearApplicationDeadline under condition
    check.oneYearSinceDecision = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label exceeded_year definition oneYearApplicationDeadline equals No

# Twenty day hearing deadline
  label twenty_days definition twentyDayHearingDeadline under condition
    check.twentyDaysSinceApplication = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label exceeded definition twentyDayHearingDeadline equals No
```

## Article 381. Special reversal rules for certain categories

```catala
declaration scope Article381SpecialReversal:
  input check content SpecialReversalCheck
  output reversalRestrictedToFalseEvidence content YesNo

scope Article381SpecialReversal:
# Reversal restricted to false evidence for personal injury, pension, public service salary
  label restricted definition reversalRestrictedToFalseEvidence under condition
    (check.decisionRegardingPersonalInjury = Yes
    or check.decisionRegardingPensionPayments = Yes
    or check.decisionRegardingPublicServiceSalary = Yes)
    and check.decisionBasedOnFalseEvidence = No
    and check.decisionBasedOnForgedDocuments = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label false_evidence definition reversalRestrictedToFalseEvidence under condition
    (check.decisionRegardingPersonalInjury = Yes
    or check.decisionRegardingPensionPayments = Yes
    or check.decisionRegardingPublicServiceSalary = Yes)
    and (check.decisionBasedOnFalseEvidence = Yes
    or check.decisionBasedOnForgedDocuments = Yes)
    consequence equals No

  label not_restricted definition reversalRestrictedToFalseEvidence equals No
```

## Article 381-1. Judicial control over execution

```catala
declaration scope Article381_1JudicialControl:
  input check content JudicialControlCheck
  output judicialControlByFirstInstance content YesNo

scope Article381_1JudicialControl:
# Judicial control exercised by first instance court
  label first_instance definition judicialControlByFirstInstance under condition
    check.firstInstanceDecided = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_control definition judicialControlByFirstInstance equals No
```

## Article 382. Application for ordering report on execution

```catala
declaration scope Article382ReportApplication:
  input check content ReportApplicationCheck
  output mayOrderReport content YesNo
  output mustOrderReportForSocialPayments content YesNo

scope Article382ReportApplication:
# May order report on court initiative or beneficiary application
  label beneficiary definition mayOrderReport under condition
    check.filedByBeneficiary = Yes
    and check.beneficiaryNotAuthoritySubject = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label court_initiative definition mayOrderReport under condition
    check.courtInitiative = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_order definition mayOrderReport equals No

# Must order report for social payment cases
  label social definition mustOrderReportForSocialPayments under condition
    check.caseRegardingSocialPayments = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_social definition mustOrderReportForSocialPayments equals No
```

## Article 382-1. Consideration of application for ordering report

```catala
declaration scope Article382_1ReportConsideration:
  input check content ReportApplicationCheck
  output tenDayWrittenDeadline content YesNo
  output reportDeadlineBetweenTenDaysAndThreeMonths content YesNo

scope Article382_1ReportConsideration:
# Ten day written deadline
  label ten_days definition tenDayWrittenDeadline under condition
    check.tenDaysSinceApplication = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label exceeded definition tenDayWrittenDeadline equals No

# Report deadline between 10 days and 3 months
  label within_range definition reportDeadlineBetweenTenDaysAndThreeMonths under condition
    check.minTenDaysForReport = Yes
    and check.maxThreeMonthsForReport = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label outside_range definition reportDeadlineBetweenTenDaysAndThreeMonths equals No
```

## Article 382-2. Review of execution report

```catala
declaration scope Article382_2ReportReview:
  input check content ReportReviewCheck
  output tenDayReviewDeadline content YesNo

scope Article382_2ReportReview:
# Ten day review deadline
  label ten_days definition tenDayReviewDeadline under condition
    check.tenDaysSinceReport = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label exceeded definition tenDayReviewDeadline equals No
```

## Article 382-3. Decision following review of report

```catala
declaration scope Article382_3ReportDecision:
  input check content ReportDecisionCheck
  output mayAcceptOrRejectReport content YesNo
  output mayImposeFine content YesNo
  output maySetNewDeadline content YesNo

scope Article382_3ReportDecision:
# Accept or reject report
  label accept definition mayAcceptOrRejectReport under condition
    check.reportAccepted = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label reject definition mayAcceptOrRejectReport under condition
    check.reportRejected = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_decision definition mayAcceptOrRejectReport equals No

# May impose fine
  label fine definition mayImposeFine under condition
    check.reportRejected = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_fine definition mayImposeFine equals No

# May set new deadline
  label new_deadline definition maySetNewDeadline under condition
    check.newReportDeadlineSet = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_new_deadline definition maySetNewDeadline equals No
```

## Article 383. Recognizing unlawful actions during execution

```catala
declaration scope Article383UnlawfulActions:
  input check content UnlawfulActionCheck
  output mayRecognizeUnlawful content YesNo
  output tenDayApplicationDeadline content YesNo

scope Article383UnlawfulActions:
# May recognize actions as unlawful
  label unlawful definition mayRecognizeUnlawful under condition
    check.plaintiffFiledApplication = Yes
    and check.applicationMeetsRequirements = Yes
    and check.unlawfulActionsEstablished = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label rights_violation definition mayRecognizeUnlawful under condition
    check.plaintiffFiledApplication = Yes
    and check.applicationMeetsRequirements = Yes
    and check.rightsViolationEstablished = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_unlawful definition mayRecognizeUnlawful equals No

# Ten day application deadline
  label within_deadline definition tenDayApplicationDeadline under condition
    check.tenDaysSinceAwareOfViolation = Yes
    and check.withinEnforcementDeadline = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label exceeded definition tenDayApplicationDeadline equals No
```
